                    <section id="value-proposition" data-toc-section>


<section class="value-proposition value-proposition--page-default" id="value-proposition" data-toc-section
         aria-labelledby="value-proposition-title">
    <div class="container-fluid px-4 px-lg-5">
        <div class="value-proposition__content">
                <h2 class="visually-hidden" id="value-proposition-title">Value Proposition</h2>
                <div class="value-proposition__cards">
                    


<article class="value-proposition__card" style="--value-proposition-bullet-color: #874451; --value-proposition-link-color: #874451;">
    <div class="value-proposition__card-copy">
            <div class="value-proposition__card-title">
Ingest, Organize, and Centralize Contracts</div>

            <div class="value-proposition__card-text">
                
Bring legacy and third-party contracts into one repository that becomes your trusted system of record.
            </div>

        <div class="value-proposition__points">
            
<ul>
<li>Ingest legacy and third party contracts using Discover so teams quickly bring all agreements into one place.</li>
<li>Use Discover to convert unstructured contract documents into structured, searchable data.</li>
<li>Maintain a governed repository with indexing, version history, and contract relationships for traceability.</li>
</ul>
        </div>

    </div>

        <div class="value-proposition__card-media">
