            <h3 class="customer-stories__card-title">
                    <a href="/customers/customer-stories/daimler/"
                       style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">Daimler Streamlines Sourcing Contracts, Drives Digital Transformation with Icertis Contract Intelligence</a>
            </h3>


            <p class="customer-stories__card-copy">Witness how Daimler, a leading automotive manufacturer, leveraged the power of Icertis Contract Intelligence (ICI) platform to revolutionize their contracting and sourcing processes. Discover how they reduced costs, mitigated supplier risks, and accelerated time-to-market through contract-centric sourcing. Watch the customer story video to learn more.</p>

            <div class="customer-stories__author">
                <span class="customer-stories__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <p class="customer-stories__author-name">Ulrich Ochmann</p>
            </div>
