<section class="faq-section" id="faq" data-toc-section aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="container-fluid px-4 px-lg-5">
        <div class="faq-section__inner">
            <div class="faq-section__intro">
                    <h2 class="faq-section__title" id="faq-title">FAQs</h2>
                    <p class="faq-section__subtitle mb-0">Manage the full contract lifecycle with visibility, control, and standardized workflows</p>
                    <a class="btn btn-underline faq-section__button" href="/contact-us/" title="Contact Us">
                        Contact Us
                    </a>
            </div>

                <div class="faq-section__accordion" data-faq-accordion>
                    


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-3754a6b4"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-3754a6b4"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">What is Icertis Contract Management (ICM) Platform? </span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-3754a6b4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-3754a6b4" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">Icertis Contract Management (ICM) Platform helps enterprises run contract operations at scale with centralized contracts, standardized workflows, instant answers, and connected enterprise systems. </p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-2d987707"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-2d987707"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">Who uses ICM Platform?</span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-2d987707" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-2d987707" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">ICM Platform is used by large enterprises and regulated organizations across legal, sales, procurement, finance, and compliance teams managing high-volume, complex contracts.    </p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-87c3ad87"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-87c3ad87"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">What are the key features of ICM Platform? </span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-87c3ad87" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-87c3ad87" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">Key ICM Platform features include centralized contract storage, instant answers across contracts, standardized workflows, governance controls, and integrations with enterprise systems.</p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-dbf5aa65"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-dbf5aa65"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">What business problems does ICM Platform solve?</span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-dbf5aa65" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-dbf5aa65" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">ICM Platform  helps enterprises reduce contract risk, improve compliance, increase contract visibility, accelerate execution, and maintain consistent contract operations at scale. </p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-8b15aae1"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-8b15aae1"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">What types of contracts can ICM Platform manage?</span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-8b15aae1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-8b15aae1" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">ICM Platform manages sales contracts, procurement agreements, NDAs, MSAs, SOWs, and other enterprise contracts across regions, languages, and regulatory requirements.</p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-9173d831"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-9173d831"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">How does ICM Platform support the full contract lifecycle?</span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-9173d831" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-9173d831" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">ICM Platform supports request, drafting, negotiation, approval, execution, and post-execution governance through centralized data and standardized processes. </p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-d47159e4"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-d47159e4"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">Does ICM Platform integrate with enterprise systems?</span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-d47159e4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-d47159e4" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">Yes. ICM Platform integrates with SAP, Salesforce, Microsoft Dynamics, Microsoft 365, Workday, and other enterprise systems to connect contracts with business workflows.</p>
        </div>
</article>


<article class="faq-section__item" data-faq-item>
        <h3 class="faq-section__heading">
            <button
                class="faq-section__trigger"
                type="button"
                id="faq-trigger-1a0dbd5b"
                aria-expanded="false"
                aria-controls="faq-panel-1a0dbd5b"
                data-faq-trigger
            >
                <span class="faq-section__question">How is ICM Platform different from other CLM solutions?</span>
                <span class="faq-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 10" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M1 9L9 1L17 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </span>
            </button>
        </h3>

        <div class="faq-section__panel" id="faq-panel-1a0dbd5b" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-1a0dbd5b" data-faq-panel hidden>
            <p class="faq-section__answer mb-0">ICM Platform  combines structured contract data, standardized workflows, instant answers, and enterprise-grade governance to support complex contract operations reliably at scale. </p>
        </div>
</article>

